---
const points = [
  {
    verb: 'The brand',
    body: 'The name and the visual language were shaped through an agentic process: options generated and explored by machine, the final call made by a person. A family of related identities, not a logo handed down.',
  },
  {
    verb: 'The build',
    body: 'The tools, and this very site, are developed the agent-centric way we advocate: work driven from written specs and Claude Code sessions, each change tracing back to an intent you can read. Assistance, never autopilot.',
  },
  {
    verb: 'The design system',
    body: 'One shared, token-based design system underpins every surface. Agents maintain and migrate it across products, and an automated audit fails the build on any drift from it. This site\'s content is schema-validated too, so a wrong edit does not ship; it stops the build instead.',
  },
];
---

<section id="method" class="section method">
  <div class="wrap method__grid">
    <div class="method__head">
      <div class="section-index">
        <span class="section-index__no">03</span>
        <span class="eyebrow">The method</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="h2">Made the way it's meant to run.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Sondalab builds tools for directing agents, and it is built by directing
        them. People set the intent and hold the switch; the machine does the
        work, in the open, every step traceable and reversible. The brand, the
        design system, and this very site came out of that same loop.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="method__points">
      {points.map((p, i) => (
        <li class="mpoint">
          <span class="mpoint__no">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <div class="mpoint__body">
            <h3 class="mpoint__verb">{p.verb}</h3>
            <p>{p.body}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .method__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }
  @media (min-width: 52rem) {
    .method__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .method__head {
      position: sticky;
      top: 6rem;
    }
  }
  .method__head .h2 { margin-top: 1.25rem; max-width: 16ch; }
  .method__head .lede { margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 42ch; }

  .method__points { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .mpoint {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    padding-block: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-border-subtle);
  }
  .mpoint:first-child { border-top: 0; padding-top: 0; }

  .mpoint__no {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-weight: 100;
    font-size: var(--step-numeral);
    line-height: 0.8;
    color: var(--sl-text-muted);
  }
  .mpoint__verb {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-display);
    font-weight: 440;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72, 'WONK' 1;
    font-size: var(--step-h3);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: var(--sl-text-primary);
  }
  .mpoint__body p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: var(--sl-text-secondary);
  }
</style>
